I swear... I can never remember the syntax to change MySQL's safe update mode.  I always have to google it.
To turn off safe update mode:
SET SQL_SAFE_UPDATES = 0;

Please remember to set it back to 1 after running your mass-update/mass-delete query.
SET SQL_SAFE_UPDATES = 1;

Safe coding!
